
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.037379944 0.016104234 -0.08908687) to (82.05862 81.237863 84.401087)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
